### The report finance asked about (January has 31 days, 30 orders in the seed data)
GET http://localhost:8080/reports/monthly?month=2026-01

### A value that is not a month: 400, and the body carries the traceId support asks for
GET http://localhost:8080/reports/monthly?month=2026-13

### Report cache statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/reports/cache

### Drop every cached report
POST http://localhost:8080/reports/cache/invalidate
